<p id="cloud-backup-update-2026-10-21-0030-utc"><strong><span style="color: #24326a;">Update: Wednesday, October 21, 2026 at 00:30 UTC</span></strong></p>
<h6><strong>Cloud Backup service interruption update</strong></h6>
<p>As previously reported, we identified unauthorized access to application identities associated with Cloud Backup, formerly SkyKick.</p>
<p>We continue advancing remediation and security validation as we prepare for phased service restoration. Following the completed account and credential reset in the affected Cloud Backup environment, we remain focused on validating remediation and preparing to restore services safely. Previously published findings and partner guidance remain current.</p>
<h6><strong>Technical resources for partners</strong></h6>
<p>Reviewing individual Microsoft 365 environments remains essential. Our <a aria-label="Link technical investigation and remediation guide" id="menurg06" href="/contentassets/10777cd3364d440c86ed5270a94a5f24/connectwise-cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation-guide-1.pdf" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/contentassets/10777cd3364d440c86ed5270a94a5f24/connectwise-cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation-guide-1.pdf">technical investigation and remediation guide</a> provides detailed steps for reviewing your own tenant and each managed customer tenant, including legacy SkyKick integrations.</p>
<p>We have launched our <a aria-label="Link technical webinar series" id="menurg09" href="/webinars/cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/webinars/cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation">technical webinar series</a>, with sessions continuing every two hours to help partners apply the published guidance. These sessions provide hands-on walkthroughs of Microsoft Entra ID sign-in and audit logs, application registrations, credentials, and permissions. Please register for an upcoming session and share the invitation with the administrators responsible for your customer environments.</p>
<p>Keep affected application connections disabled until ConnectWise provides formal re-enablement instructions.</p>
<p>Resellers, distributors, and marketplace partners should ensure this guidance reaches the responsible customer administrators.</p>
<h6><strong>Service status</strong></h6>
<p>Cloud Backup, SaaS Security, and Cloud Management remain suspended. Existing backup archives remain encrypted, isolated, and preserved, with no indication of compromise. These findings do not establish whether individual partner or customer Microsoft 365 environments were affected.</p>
<p>We continue monitoring our partner-facing services and broader environment around the clock, with no indication that other ConnectWise products, services, or offerings are impacted.</p>
<p>We recognize the continued disruption to your business and customers. We will share restoration timing and any required reconnection instructions as soon as confirmed.</p>
<p><strong>Our next update will be published by October 21 at 13:00 UTC.</strong> We will communicate significant developments sooner as they are confirmed.</p>
<p>Visit the <a aria-label="Link ConnectWise Trust Center" id="menurg0c" href="/company/trust/advisories" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/company/trust/advisories">ConnectWise Trust Center</a> for current facts, service status, and guidance. Contact Partner Care for service assistance and report suspicious activity to <a aria-label="Link SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com" id="menurg0f" href="mailto:SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="mailto:securitypartnersupport@connectwise.com">SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com</a>.</p>
