<p id="cloud-backup-update-2026-10-20-1900-utc"><strong><span style="color: #24326a;">Update: Tuesday, October 20, 2026 at 19:00 UTC</span></strong></p>
<h6><strong>Cloud Backup service interruption update</strong></h6>
<p>As previously reported, we identified unauthorized access to application identities associated with Cloud Backup, formerly SkyKick.</p>
<p>We have completed an account and credential reset in the affected Cloud Backup environment and are preparing for phased service restoration. <strong>We take responsibility for keeping you informed and restoring service safely.</strong></p>
<h6><strong>Account and credential reset completed</strong></h6>
<p>On October 19, we completed a full reset of all accounts and credentials in the affected Cloud Backup environment. We continue monitoring around the clock and are completing security validation before moving to the next phase.</p>
<h6><strong>Preparing for phased restoration</strong></h6>
<p>Our engineering and operations teams are preparing to restore services in controlled phases. Each step will proceed only after passing a security review. We will restore core infrastructure first, with additional review of the most sensitive connections.</p>
<p>Once restoration begins, we expect the process to take several days. We will share a more reliable timeline after the first full day of restoration work and provide instructions before partners need to re-enable connections.</p>
<p>Cloud Backup, SaaS Security, and Cloud Management remain suspended. Scheduled backups, archive access, restores, SaaS Security monitoring and alerting, and Cloud Management user and license management remain unavailable. We recognize the continued disruption to your business and customers.</p>
<h6><strong>Ongoing investigation</strong></h6>
<p>We continue working with independent third-party specialists to determine how the unauthorized access first occurred and its full scope. Review of individual partner and customer Microsoft 365 tenants remains essential.</p>
<h6><strong>Actions for partners</strong></h6>
<p>Keep affected Cloud Backup application connections disabled until ConnectWise provides formal re-enablement instructions. Continue reviewing your own Microsoft 365 tenant and each managed customer tenant using the <a aria-label="Link technical investigation and remediation guide" id="menur8svf" href="/contentassets/10777cd3364d440c86ed5270a94a5f24/connectwise-cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation-guide-1.pdf" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/contentassets/10777cd3364d440c86ed5270a94a5f24/connectwise-cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation-guide-1.pdf">technical investigation and remediation guide</a>.</p>
<p>Our <a aria-label="Link technical webinar series" id="menur8svi" href="/webinars/cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/webinars/cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation">technical webinar series</a> provides hands-on walkthroughs of the investigation guidance.</p>
<p>Resellers, distributors, and marketplace partners should ensure this guidance reaches responsible customer administrators.</p>
<p>We will continue sharing progress and restoration updates through the <a aria-label="Link ConnectWise Trust Center" id="menur8svl" href="/company/trust/advisories" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/company/trust/advisories">ConnectWise Trust Center</a>. Contact Partner Care for service assistance and report suspicious activity to <a aria-label="Link SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com" id="menur8svo" href="mailto:SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="mailto:securitypartnersupport@connectwise.com">SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com</a>.</p>
