<p id="cloud-backup-update-2026-10-20-1245-utc"><strong><span style="color: #24326a;">Update: Tuesday, October 20, 2026 at 12:45 UTC</span></strong></p>
<p><strong></strong></p>
<h6><strong>Cloud Backup service interruption update</strong></h6>
<p>As previously reported, we identified unauthorized access to application identities associated with Cloud Backup, formerly SkyKick.</p>
<p>Our teams and third-party specialists continue advancing remediation, resetting accounts, replacing application credentials, and validating the affected environment for safe restoration. <strong>We take responsibility for keeping you informed and restoring service safely.</strong></p>
<h6><strong>Technical webinars for partners</strong></h6>
<p><strong>We are launching technical webinars</strong> <strong>every two hours beginning today, October 20, at 18:00 UTC</strong>.</p>
<p>The sessions provide a hands-on walkthrough of Microsoft Entra ID sign-in and audit logs, application registrations, credentials, and permissions to support investigation of your Microsoft 365 tenants, including legacy backup integrations.<strong> </strong><a aria-label="Link Register and select a session" id="menur7ier" href="/webinars/cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/webinars/cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation">Register and select a session</a>.</p>
<h6><strong>Actions completed and work underway</strong></h6>
<p>We have disabled affected application connections, strengthened administrative-access protections, engaged independent specialists, and published technical investigation guidance. SaaS Security and Cloud Management remain suspended as a precaution because they are integrated with Cloud Backup.</p>
<p>We are monitoring our entire environment around the clock. Since mitigations began on October 17 at 05:00 UTC, we have not observed successful threat activity in the environments we monitor. This does not establish whether individual partner or customer Microsoft 365 tenants were affected; each potentially affected tenant still requires review.</p>
<p>We have no indication that other ConnectWise products, services, or offerings are impacted beyond these three services. We plan a controlled, phased restoration following required remediation and security validation, with partner instructions provided before re-enablement.</p>
<h6><strong>Service availability and stored backups</strong></h6>
<p>Existing backup archives remain encrypted, isolated, and preserved, with no indication of compromise. Cloud Backup jobs, archive access, and restores remain unavailable, along with SaaS Security monitoring and alerting and Cloud Management user and license management.</p>
<p>We recognize the disruption to your business and customers and will share restoration timing as soon as it is confirmed.</p>
<h6><strong>Actions for partners</strong></h6>
<p>Continue following the <a aria-label="Link technical investigation and remediation guide" id="menur7ieu" href="/contentassets/10777cd3364d440c86ed5270a94a5f24/connectwise-cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation-guide-1.pdf" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/contentassets/10777cd3364d440c86ed5270a94a5f24/connectwise-cloud-backup-technical-investigation-and-remediation-guide-1.pdf">technical investigation and remediation guide</a> and accompanying video for your own and managed customer tenants. Keep affected applications disabled pending formal restoration instructions.</p>
<p>Resellers, distributors, and marketplace partners should ensure this guidance reaches responsible customer administrators.</p>
<p><strong>Our next update will be published by October 20 at 19:00 UTC. We will communicate significant developments as they are confirmed.</strong></p>
<p>Visit the <a aria-label="Link Trust Center" id="menur7if1" href="/company/trust/advisories" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="https://www.connectwise.com/company/trust/advisories">Trust Center</a> for updates. Contact Partner Care for service assistance and report suspicious activity to <a aria-label="Link SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com" id="menur7if4" href="mailto:SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" class="fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn" title="mailto:securitypartnersupport@connectwise.com">SecurityPartnerSupport@ConnectWise.com</a>.</p>
