<td style="border-color: #000000; border-width: 1px; padding: 12px;">Cloud Management - MS Teams</td>
<td style="border-color: #000000; border-width: 1px; padding: 12px;">24205314-2b89-4e07-a2a4-579e898a5640</td>
</tr>
