<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="%1." data-font="" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Edit a role that you have assigned to your&nbsp;</span><span>users</span><span>.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:60,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="%1." data-font="" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Review each session group that has permissions assigned to it</span><span>; these session groups will be in </span><span>a </span><span>bold font</span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:60,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="%1." data-font="" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>For each session group, in the Scoped Permissions window,&nbsp;</span><span>check if the </span></span><b><span data-contrast="auto"><span>TransferFiles</span></span></b><span data-contrast="auto"><span> permission</span><span> (or </span><span>TransferFIlesInSession</span><span> for legacy versions)</span><span> is selected.</span><span> If it is, deselect it.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:60,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="%1." data-font="" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Save your</span><span> chang</span><span>es to the role.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:60,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="%1." data-font="" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:0,&quot;469769242&quot;:[65533,0],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;%1.&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Repeat for each role&nbsp;</span><span>that</span><span>&rsquo;s</span><span> defined </span><span>in</span><span> your instance or installation.</span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:60,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:60,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}">&nbsp;</span></li>
